  "description": "# **The Faults of Exile**\n\n##### Accepting applications\n\n🔸No mandatory resource donations for Cursed and Banished players, Forsaken and other market characters encouraged to donate.\n\n🔸Must be able to join raids, if not, you must be actively working on leveling combat. \n\n🔸Raids twice daily at 6:05am + 7:05am (UTC).\n\n🔸We are focused on leveling characters and building the Guild Hall.  Planned additions: Teleport Beacon, Energizing Pool.\n\n### **𝕸𝖆𝖞 𝕲𝖔𝖉 𝖍𝖆𝖛𝖊 𝖒𝖊𝖗𝖈𝖞 𝖔𝖓 𝖙𝖍𝖊 𝖍𝖊𝖝𝖊𝖉.**\n\n## **• • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • •**\n\n### 📜 **𝕲𝖚𝖎𝖑𝖉 𝕹𝖊𝖜𝖘** 📜\n\n🔸New Guild Hall slot under contruction.  Planning to use this for the Pool\n\n###### Established April &#039;26 • • •\n###### discord.gg/wnEhRZFVfE",
